      "content": "hobbies? new purposes? it sounds like you're talking about filling time, but i'm talking about the fact that the version of me that mattered is dead too. it feels less like \"grief\" and more like i've reached the end of my story. like i've finished my part and there's nothing left for the credits to roll on. why should i bother starting a whole new chapter when the main character is already gone?",
